{"lines": ["A ten-foot figure with a blood-red face glided toward seven witnesses. Nobody has ever fully explained it.", "September 1952. A bright light crosses the sky above Flatwoods, West Virginia.", "Boys see it drop behind a farm. They run for help, and a mother grabs a flashlight.", "Seven people climb the hill in the dark. A red light pulses at the top.", "A guardsman raises the flashlight. A tall shape stares back, round red face, pointed hood.", "It hisses. It glides toward them. He screams, drops the light, and they all run.", "And that's not the strange part. Afterward, a pungent mist hung in the air. The boys' throats swelled.", "The Air Force blamed a meteor and three red beacons. The monster? A startled barn owl.", "Case closed? The witnesses never accepted it. So what did they see on that hill? Tell me below."], "words": [["A", 0.0, 0.08], ["ten-foot", 0.08, 0.56], ["figure", 0.56, 0.94], ["with", 0.94, 1.24], ["a", 1.24, 1.34], ["blood-red", 1.34, 1.8], ["face", 1.8, 2.16], ["glided", 2.16, 2.74], ["toward", 2.74, 3.02], ["seven", 3.02, 3.44], ["witnesses.", 3.44, 3.86], ["Nobody", 4.62, 4.92], ["has", 4.92, 5.22], ["ever", 5.22, 5.5], ["fully", 5.5, 5.78], ["explained", 5.78, 6.24], ["it.", 6.24, 6.62], ["September", 7.14, 7.42], ["1952.", 7.42, 8.42], ["A", 9.46, 9.62], ["bright", 9.62, 9.82], ["light", 9.82, 10.1], ["crosses", 10.1, 10.52], ["the", 10.52, 10.84], ["sky", 10.84, 11.06], ["above", 11.06, 11.44], ["Flatwoods,", 11.44, 12.0], ["West", 12.0, 12.36], ["Virginia.", 12.36, 12.84], ["Boys", 13.579, 13.74], ["see", 13.74, 14.18], ["it", 14.18, 14.3], ["drop", 14.3, 14.48], ["behind", 14.48, 14.88], ["a", 14.88, 15.04], ["farm.", 15.04, 15.3], ["They", 15.86, 15.9], ["run", 15.9, 16.08], ["for", 16.08, 16.3], ["help,", 16.3, 16.54], ["and", 16.54, 16.88], ["a", 16.88, 16.96], ["mother", 16.96, 17.18], ["grabs", 17.18, 17.48], ["a", 17.48, 17.72], ["flashlight.", 17.72, 17.94], ["Seven", 18.927, 19.16], ["people", 19.16, 19.54], ["climb", 19.